{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_title", "source_sha256": "689fb2bf5fc75c37493c8f32893b114980e81dd94b96a652c1801dbfe4dabaf6", "ja": "宇宙からこんにちは！", "zh": "来自宇宙的问候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1ea9eded53517ddad80344dc623991bbb16ad02a3a857e71136517f8bd48d339", "ja": "ロケットで宇宙まで来た（？）\n昴、紬、エレナ、やよい。\nもう怖いものなんてない。\n765プロは最強だ！", "zh": "乘着火箭来到宇宙（？）\n昴、纺、艾丽娜、弥生。\n已经没有什么可怕的了。\n765制作人最强！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_1000_null", "source_sha256": "f91a6d637956e02cbf44d9d7306aab357efb31e0cd93c02ebb6cd58882a6e98d", "ja": "フライトモード、オン……全システム、準備完了……\nメインエンジンスタート……リフトオフ！", "zh": "飞行模式，开启……全系统，准备完毕……\n主引擎启动……升空！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_1001_null", "source_sha256": "c34a64c94b509f6fac35745055713b4a04a7202d0eb15adf7923c2806b9a8017", "ja": "ドドドドドドドドーッ！", "zh": "咚咚咚咚咚咚咚咚——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2783eb43d3a51e2ae76c8ea08297ee21423d4422fe9def26efb461d6b9523de6", "ja": "……はっ！？　ここは……。\nえっ……う、宇宙空間！？　な、なぜ……！？", "zh": "……哈！？这里是……\n诶……宇、宇宙空间！？为、为什么会……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "8dc28ebf86404d90c0dc9d4d4a5c9c64f95553ad5f13b2c7c4a9471b33a68ea7", "ja": "うっうー！　『765プロあどべん☆チャンネル』の\n時間ですー！　今回は宇宙からお届けしてまーすっ！", "zh": "呜呜——！“765职业冒险☆频道”的\n时间到啦！这次要从宇宙为您播报啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "8f9593329549cea7fb8e6e87e3a299a41a0bc7e6b6b832674e50271aa86064a5", "ja": "へへっ♪　宇宙まで来て仕事するなんて、\nアイドルってすっげーよな！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪居然来到宇宙工作，偶像真厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "ac070e3af2385079c310e9b7f74435bc5f2924f0d8eea4293e204108baf88828", "ja": "地球は青いネ！　まんまるで、かわいい！\n大切な大切な星だヨ～！", "zh": "地球好蓝呀！圆溜溜的，真可爱！\n是我们最宝贵最宝贵的星球哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5406cace8e9c04fc5a9c3686125e56449a6bba9ba6d1b03e7faf9b8063ed3fec", "ja": "あの……ここは本当に、宇宙なのですか？\n色々とおかしいのでは……？", "zh": "那个……这里真的是宇宙吗？\n感觉有各种不对劲的地方吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "26a1306d6d06f101b14dad49a61e0fa6c29f11eda430438f05d6291ffbd42870", "ja": "ん？　いや、どっからどう見ても宇宙だろ。\nなぁ、やよい？", "zh": "嗯？不管从哪里看，这都是宇宙吧。\n对吧，弥生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "905ef5e55863ac4e9e555558ab39fa4d633907b7f8e77f03f92eeefcc41f3f55", "ja": "はいー！　ロケットでバビューンって！\n気持ちよかったですー！", "zh": "是——！坐火箭“嗖”地一下飞过去！\n感觉真棒——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0339_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_12_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "392e4c1568b0d08a920204199fd623a938fdfdf395adfc2bb8ec0fe118f59527", "ja": "遠くまで来ちゃったネ♪　でも、どこに行っても、\n絶対にみんなのところに帰るから、待っててネ～！", "zh": "一不小心都跑到这么远的地方来了呢♪ 不过，不管去到哪里，我绝对都会回到大家身边的，所以要等着我哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
